Group gSensors

Switch Sensor1 (gSensors)
Switch Sensor1_Status (gSensors) ["Status"]

Switch Sensor2 (gSensors)
Switch Sensor2_Status (gSensors) ["Status", "Power"]

Group MySensorEquipment "Mein Sensor-Equipment" ["Equipment"]
Switch SomeSensor "Sensor" (MySensorEquipment) ["Sensor"]
Switch SomeSensor_Status "Sensor Status" (MySensorEquipment) ["Status"]
